    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Adelyde",
            "It wasn't that smooth. New problems came up almost right away.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Clausen",
            "New problems...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Clausen",
            "Don't tell me the explosion was one of them.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "The explosion came later, but let me walk you through it in order. Moses did connect to the master AI, but I couldn't activate its full functionality.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "The four nodes and the master AI aren't set up as a hierarchy. They're symbiotic. To bring Moses fully online, I had to locate the other three and connect them all to the master AI.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "Only when all four nodes are in place can the master AI issue unified commands across every module.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "So to accomplish my mission objective, I decided to head for the other nodes...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Clausen",
            "The other nodes... Then what was inside them...?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 306,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "Captain Clausen, I know exactly why this ship is really here. Officially, you're my extraction. Unofficially, Kurono ordered you to recover every scrap of intel and every last clearance related to the Millennium Project from me.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 306
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "Am I wrong?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 25,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Clausen",
            "Um...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "Ever since the Red Tide started spilling from the Atlantic Eye, Babylonia has been locked in negotiations with the TEC. The interests tangled up in this are staggering.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "But unlike Babylonia, which wanted to resolve things immediately, the TEC's leadership refused to disclose all their intel. Too many interests at stake. It made any follow-up operations extremely difficult.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "Kurono, though, is in a different spot. You negotiated your own arrangements with the TEC leadership through your own channels. But having to deal with partners who push back doesn't sit well with you.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
        "ActionId": 31,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "So to gain leverage for the next round of talks, you need more bargaining chips. And the reason you're sitting here listening to my story is simple: this unexpected Millennium Project is the perfect chip.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 32,
        "ActionId": 32,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Clausen",
            "...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Clausen",
            "And so what if you've figured us out, Lieutenant Colonel? You're on my ship. If you're thinking of holding anything back—",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "I'm giving you everything. The entire Millennium Project. Moses included.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Clausen",
            "What...?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Clausen",
            "Did I hear that right?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "My objective was never about power struggles. It was about doing whatever I could to contain this crisis. If we keep locking horns here, we both lose.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Clausen",
            "So if you're handing it all over, that means you've already linked up every node. Is that what you're telling me?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "That's right. Once I understood the symbiotic link between the nodes and the master AI, I followed the signal traces the satellites had picked up and located the second node of the Millennium Project.",
            2
        ]
    },
