    },
    {
        "Id": 57,
        "ActionId": 57,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The beams tore through the ink-blue murk to expose her surroundings. She found herself moving through a colossal crevasse in the seabed, its ancient walls honeycombed by centuries of erosion."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 58,
        "ActionId": 58,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "On the way down, she caught sight of waterlogged wood trapped in the crevices, carried here by currents from some forgotten place. Listless fish hung in the water, drifting with the tide and paying her no mind."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 59,
        "ActionId": 59,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The proximity alarm chimed as the seafloor neared, and Adelyde tilted the searchlight to face the depths below. A terrace of ochre sediment slowly emerged from the gloom."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 60,
        "ActionId": 60,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
