    {
        "Id": 114,
        "ActionId": 114,
        "Type": 304,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "Symbiotic Sirens are deep-sea combat submersible units developed and mass-produced exclusively by the Spelmin family.",
            "ffffffff",
            0.8,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 115,
        "ActionId": 115,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "The project's initial objective was to address two critical challenges in extreme high-pressure deep-sea environments: cargo transport and high-speed maneuverability.",
            "ffffffff",
            0.8,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 116,
        "ActionId": 116,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "The designation \"Siren\" reflects the research team's ambition: a mechanical fleet worthy of deep-sea myth, capable of commanding entire ocean territories through sheer power and presence.",
            "ffffffff",
            1.1,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 117,
        "ActionId": 117,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "To maximize frame adaptability and expandability, the Spelmin family incorporated bionic technology. The resulting configuration is near-humanoid.",
            "ffffffff",
            1,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 118,
        "ActionId": 118,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "Consequently, the Symbiotic Siren's defensive weaponry and close-quarters combat capabilities far exceed standard units deployed in other nodes of the Millennium Project.",
            "ffffffff",
            1,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 119,
        "ActionId": 119,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "The Spelmin family designated the Sirens as the project's dedicated defensive battle force. Their assigned roles are security, escort operations, and high-risk zone clearance in the event of a crisis.",
            "ffffffff",
            1.1,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
