    },
    {
        "Id": 130,
        "ActionId": 130,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "The mission objective was to investigate the effects of the regional explosion and evaluate whether the resulting disaster posed a threat to the core Millennium Project.",
            "ffffffff",
            0.6,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 131,
        "ActionId": 131,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "During the mission, some Siren units briefly surfaced to rescue survivors at sea. The observation mission continued for an extended period until the situation stabilized to an acceptable degree.",
            "ffffffff",
            1,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 132,
        "ActionId": 132,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "Upon conclusion of the observation mission, all units returned to base. Shortly thereafter, multiple units began exhibiting malfunctions, including network dropouts, erratic movement, and other anomalies.",
            "ffffffff",
            1,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 133,
        "ActionId": 133,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "Autonomous diagnostics, system reboots, and component replacements were attempted. All efforts failed to restore the compromised units.",
            "ffffffff",
            1,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 134,
        "ActionId": 134,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "The unknown corruption continued to spread. Over half the fleet began displaying hostile tendencies, actively attacking other machinery.",
            "ffffffff",
            1.4,
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory1145.jpg",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 135,
        "ActionId": 135,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
