        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Adelyde",
            "That's right. The outbreak hit just as the observation mission was wrapping up. After that, the Symbiotic Siren node lost all connection to the master AI.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 147,
        "ActionId": 147,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "With no higher intelligence left to assess the situation, they fell back on baseline protocols. And those protocols flagged them as a threat to the project.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 148,
        "ActionId": 148,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "So there, in the dark depths of the abyss, the Sirens started hunting each other down, all to protect the Millennium Project.",
