    {
        "Id": 154,
        "ActionId": 154,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Adelyde",
            "...I pushed deeper into the search. That's when I came face-to-face with a Symbiotic Siren completely corrupted by the Punishing Virus.",
            1
