        "Id": 156,
        "ActionId": 156,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "My submersible had basic weapons, but the corrupted Siren's combat capability was way beyond what I'd estimated. Just as things were about to go wrong...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 157,
        "ActionId": 157,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 158,
        "ActionId": 158,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "Another Siren burst out of the silt, with only its upper half left. But it used everything it had left to pin the other one down. I took the opening and finished the Corrupted off with the submersible.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 159,
        "ActionId": 159,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "That's when I realized that the entire seabed had been under watch the whole time.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 160,
        "ActionId": 160,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "The uncorrupted Sirens had set up a thin perimeter net around the node. They'd been lying dormant in low-power sentry mode all along, waiting on guard.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 161,
        "ActionId": 161,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Adelyde",
            "The moment they detected a Corrupted, they'd activate and move to eliminate it.",
