        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Clausen",
            "A coordinated defensive network... But you said after they disconnected from the master AI, they were running on nothing but baseline protocols. Without higher intelligence calling the shots, how do machines develop that kind of cohesion?",
